Error [jet.PrivateFailureMemberExposed]: Public fallible function `load` exposes non-public failure carrier member `PublicFailure.detail`.
  --> tests/ui/e2421_public_failure_carrier.jet:5:10
    |
  5 |     priv detail: String
    |          ^^^^^^
 Why: The public failure contract makes `PublicFailure.detail` part of the callable's visible carrier, but its declaration is not public.
 Fix: Remove `priv` from `PublicFailure.detail` or move it out of its `priv module`, or move `load` into a `priv module`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2421

